  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Window Cell Manufacture</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Rotary-Window-b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Novel 22 ft (6.7 m)&nbsp;diameter rotary table</li>\n<li>Six simultaneous operations</li>\n<li>Operators from 6 to 2</li>\n<li>Cycle time from 30 to 18 seconds</li>\n<li>29 ft (8.8 m) long glass conveyor</li>\n<li>6 operation stations</li>\n<li>Two 3-axis sealant dispensing robots</li>\n<li>Automated glass registration and alignment robot</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Industrial Automation</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/lithium-winding-machine/\">Lithium Winding Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/lithiumcopper-laminator/\">Lithium/Copper Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/automated-end-capper/\">Automated End Capper</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/biological-assay/\">Biological Assay</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/cargo-lifter/\">Cargo Lifter</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/foam-cutting/\">Foam Cutting</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/instrumented-fetal-model/\">Instrumented Fetal Model</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/spray-booth/\">Spray Booth</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/industrial-automation/window-cell-manufacture/\">Window Cell Manufacture</a></li><li><a href=\"/industrial-automation/hail-stone-machines/\">Hail Stone Machines</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Rotary-Window-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Rotary-Window-a-300x201.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"201\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Rotary-Window-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/IA-Rotary-Window-b-300x220.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"220\" loading=\"lazy\"><